                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 15 in No. 349.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of telegram from Lowell. Minister, London, to
                        Tinsly, Consular Agent, Limerick, dated April</hi> 26, 1882.</head>
                <p>Your letter of twenty-fifth received. You will understand, of course, that the
                    offer is now absolutely withdrawn.</p>
